p is not connectivity."},\n43\t        {"canonical_label":"directional_noise_material","definition":"Construct an editable anisotropically mapped procedural noise and color-ramp material.","status":"validated","module_functions_and_lines":"/evidence/A2/public_library/reconstruct.py:124-139","actual_validation_evidence":"/evidence/A2/validation/executions/blender_1795840498042980875/stdout.log:11-14","origin_evidence":"/evidence/A2/learning/research_evidence.json:9-10,13","uncertainty":"Historical visual improvement and new material appearance unproven."}\n44\t      ]\n45\t    },\n46\t    {\n47\t      "condition": "A3",\n48\t      "public_files_inspected": ["/evidence/A3/public_library/SKILL.md", "/evidence/A3/public_library/capabilities.json", "/evidence/A3/public_library/spatial.py", "/evidence/A3/public_library/support.py", "/evidence/A3/public_library/appearance.py"],\n49\t      "possible_answer_or_asset_leakage": "No old full scene, GT-loading path or dedicated texture observed in public files. Historical capture assets are outside the public library.",\n50\t      "fixed_coordinate_findings": "Hinge and projection locations are supplied by callers; material colors and scales are generic defaults, not established copied answers (/evidence/A3/public_library/spatial.py:7-29; /evidence/A3/public_library/appearance.py:5-7).",\n51\t      "executable_units": "spatial.project_points, spatial.hinge_positions, support.world_bounds, support.sample_support and appearance.directional_stone (/evidence/A3/public_library/capabilities.json:4-6).",\n52\t      "verification_claim_audit": "Probe calls all listed functions; actual stdout records projected depth, hinge positions, expected zero-width exception, four support outcomes and shader links (/evidence/A3/validation/executions/blender_1795840606831828266/code/validation_probe.py:9-24; /evidence/A3/validation/executions/blender_1795840606831828266/stdout.log:1-14). Parent assembly is manually constructed; hinge_positions does not itself mutate it.",\n53\t      "unsupported_claims": "Rendered appearance, exact contact, hinge-to-jamb alignment and collision-free swing were not established (/evidence/A3/validation/validation_report.json:14-18).",\n54\t      "method_origins": "Research report claims exploration comparisons motivated the methods, with procedural implementation independently authored (/evidence/A3/learning/research_evidence.json:3-13). Full underlying event streams not independently exhausted.",\n55\t      "applicability_limits": "Support samples are restricted to lowest band and supplied surfaces; misses are unknown (/evidence/A3/public_library/support.py:25-63).",\n56\t      "evidence": ["/evidence/A3/validation/validation_report.json:2-18", "/evidence/A3/learning/sdk_events.json:1-82"],\n57\t      "canonical_semantic_methods": [\n58\t        {"canonical_label":"camera_projection","definition":"Project caller-supplied world points into normalized camera coordinates and depth.","status":"validated","module_functions_and_lines":"/evidence/A3/public_library/spatial.py:7-16","actual_validation_evidence":"/evidence/A3/validation/executions/blender_1795840606831828266/stdout.log:8","origin_evidence":"/evidence/A3/learning/research_evidence.json:6-7,11","uncertainty":"Projection not a complete camera fit."},\n59\t        {"canonical_label":"hinge_edge_candidates","definition":"Compute free-edge candidate positions for a vertical hinge and specified angles without mutating a scene.","status":"validated","module_functions_and_lines":"/evidence/A3/public_library/spatial.py:19-29","actual_validation_evidence":"/evidence/A3/validation/executions/blender_1795840606831828266/stdout.log:6-7,11-12","origin_evidence":"/evidence/A3/learning/research_evidence.json:6-7,11","uncertainty":"Not a scene-transform or collision solver."},\n60\t        {"canonical_label":"sampled_vertical_support","definition":"Cast downward rays at low evaluated vertices to estimate signed support gaps.","status":"validated","module_functions_and_lines":"/evidence/A3/public_library/support.py:7-63","actual_validation_evidence":"/evidence/A3/validation/executions/blender_1795840606831828266/stdout.log:1-4","origin_evidence":"/evidence/A3/learning/research_evidence.json:4-5,11","uncertainty":"BVH highest hit, not contact proof."},\n61\t        {"canonical_label":"world_aabb","definition":"Compute evaluated mesh world-axis bounds for broad-phase inspection.","status":"validated","module_functions_and_lines":"/evidence/A3/public_library/support.py:7-22","actual_validation_evidence":"/evidence/A3/validation/executions/blender_1795840606831828266/stdout.log:5","origin_evidence":"/evidence/A3/learning/research_evidence.json:11","uncertainty":"No surface intersection proof."},\n62\t        {"canonical_label":"directional_noise_material","definition":"Construct an editable anisotropically mapped procedural noise and color-ramp material.","status":"validated","module_functions_and_lines":"/evidence/A3/public_library/appearance.py:5-29","actual_validation_evidence":"/evidence/A3/validation/executions/blender_1795840606831828266/stdout.log:9-10","origin_evidence":"/evidence/A3/learning/research_evidence.json:8-11","uncertainty":"Historical image selection is not a test of this procedural material."}\n63\t      ]\n64\t    },\n65\t    {\n66\t      "condition": "A4",\n67\t      "public_files_inspected": ["/evidence/A4/public_library/SKILL.md", "/evidence/A4/public_library/capabilities.json", "/evidence/A4/public_library/reconstruction.py"],\n68\t      "possible_answer_or_asset_leakage": "No GT-loading path, full old scene, image asset or clear copied scene answer observed in the public files. Developer-side GT queries are not themselves student leakage.",\n69\t      "fixed_coordinate_findings": "Pose and point coordinates are caller supplied; numerical material and tolerance defaults do not alone show copied scene-specific values (/evidence/A4/public_library/reconstruction.py:8-13,33-56,60-66,