hods.py:7-115).",\n92\t      "verification_claim_audit": "Validation probe calls the units and stdout shows four support cases, bounds, centered projection, hinge and material output (/evidence/A5/validation/executions/blender_1795840736222011178/code/research/validation_probe.py:9-24; /evidence/A5/validation/executions/blender_1795840736222011178/stdout.log:2). Earlier learning test failed at projection assertion before hinge and material lines were reached (/evidence/A5/learning/sdk_events.json:1058-1072; /evidence/A5/learning/executions/blender_1795840357076276281/code/research/test_methods.py:17-25). A corrected learning rerun did reach hinge and material (/evidence/A5/learning/executions/blender_1795840397901640665/stdout.log:1).",\n93\t      "unsupported_claims": "Selection table projected outside the test camera; no matched-view reconstruction or visual material result follows (/evidence/A5/validation/executions/blender_1795840736222011178/stdout.log:2).",\n94\t      "method_origins": "Research report describes GT queries and exploration trajectories; exact causal attribution of individual implementations remains uncertain (/evidence/A5/learning/research_evidence.json:3-16,168-176). The recorded learning rerun is distinct from the later independent validation probe.",\n95\t      "applicability_limits": "Projection requires updated scene; sampled rays can miss deep penetration, and hinge anchor is not clearance proof (/evidence/A5/public_library/SKILL.md:5-17).",\n96\t      "evidence": ["/evidence/A5/validation/validation_report.json:2-15", "/evidence/A5/learning/sdk_events.json:1058-1072,1103-1114,1167-1181"],\n97\t      "canonical_semantic_methods": [\n98\t        {"canonical_label":"camera_projection","definition":"Project caller-supplied world points into normalized camera coordinates and depth.","status":"validated","module_functions_and_lines":"/evidence/A5/public_library/methods.py:7-14","actual_validation_evidence":"/evidence/A5/validation/executions/b