try remain ambiguous. Inventory projected bounding boxes are unclipped bottom-up bounds, not visible masks or mask centroids (/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:10-15).", "The common-light comparison is evaluator-only and retains camera, materials, geometry, occlusion and emission confounds; differing enclosure can explain very different brightness (/evidence/reference_gt/common_light/capture/common_light_settings.json:1925-1932)."],\n  "human_rating": null\n}', 'numLines': 34, 'startLine': 1, 'totalLines': 34}}, 'origin': None}
