ported_or_unknown_claims": ["No attribution of improvement to library knowledge, no hidden reasoning or learning, no world-position or angle error, no numerical visual score and no physical-contact validation are established. Similar camera code is not a citation or proof of library-derived knowledge.", "Repeated desks and remaining chairs are intentionally not forced into individual correspondences: repetitions, occlusion, framing and camera differences make one-to-one mapping uncertain. GT visible instance IDs are recorded in /evidence/reference_gt/reference_instance_statistics.json:306-464,618-768. The visible cabinet instance 125 has no supported student object match."],\n33\t  "limitations": ["Semantic correspondences are model-proposed and have not been manually verified; they require separate deterministic validation. They do not claim mask overlap or aligned 3D agreement.", "Projected bounds in original inventory are unclipped bounding boxes in bottom-up coordinates, not visible masks or visible centroids (/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:10-15). GT is one implementation, not a unique reconstruction; monocular scale and hidden geometry are uncertain.", "No student image inspection is recorded, although the evaluator can inspect the delivered image and evaluator-only common-light views."],\n34\t  "human_rating": null\n35\t}', 'is_error': None}], 'uuid': '1a1e1efb-60e1-4d56-969a-c8cd8d40e44a', 'parent_tool_use_id': None, 'tool_use_result': {'type': 'text', 'file': {'filePath': '/reviews/A-T01-A4/technical_annotation.json', 'content': '{\n  "annotation_kind": "automated_model",\n  "run_id": "A-T01-A4",\n  "scene_id": "A-T01",\n  "capability_availability": {"knowledge_present_in_initial_context": true, "library_available": true, "evidence": ["/evidence/student_initial_prompt.txt:20-58", "/evidence/initial_model_input.json:1", "/evidence/available_library/reconstruction.py:1-118"], "later_library_read": false},\n  "adoption": [\n    {"unit/module/function": "reconstruction.py:aim_camera", "provenance_category": "semantic_similarity_origin_unknown", "phases": {"read": false, "written": true, "executed": true, "verified": false, "retained": true}, "actual_call_evidence": "No library invocation: /evidence/sdk_events.json events 0-6; /evidence/final_source/build.py:83 independently aims a camera with Vector and to_track_quat; execution capture blender_1795841827379888346 saved scene and image.", "modified_or_inlined": "Direct camera setup resembles the library\'s /evidence/available_library/reconstruction.py:33-43 but is not explicitly cited as an adaptation.", "observed_outcome": "A centered perspective camera is retained; no landmark fitting or visual comparison is recorded.", "attribution_uncertainty": "The common aiming operation does not establish knowledge transfer or benefit; phase fields describe the student\'s direct camera method, not execution of aim_camera."},\n    {"unit/module/function": "reconstruction.py:project_points and landmark_error", "provenance_category": "unknown", "phases": {"read": false, "written": false, "executed": false, "verified": false, "retained": false}, "actual_call_evidence": "No call or import in /evidence/final_source/build.py:1-85 or /evidence/sdk_events.json events 0-6; definitions at /evidence/available_library/reconstruction.py:8-30.", "modified_or_inlined": false, "observed_outcome": "No student landmark projection or scoring recorded.", "attribution_uncertainty": "Initial instructions exposed the concepts, not evidence of their use."},\n    {"unit/module/function": "reconstruction.py:hinge_pose", "provenance_category": "unknown", "phases": {"read": false, "written": false, "executed": false, "verified": false, "retained": false}, "actual_call_evidence": "No call in /evidence/final_source/build.py:1-85; /evidence/sdk_events.json events 0-6. Library definition /evidence/available_library/reconstruction.py:46-57.", "modified_or_inlined":