struct.py:88-114. No texture mapping direction or scale is applicable to those plain materials.","Lighting is a tinted world plus one large area light, Cycles and AgX: /evidence/final_source/build.py:77-82. Single-view illumination and albedo are not independently identifiable. The source constructs wall-art shapes as local object meshes rather than a full-reference image plane: build.py:69-76. Evaluator summary reports no missing external images: /evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:3-7; packed-image status was not independently inspected."],\n  "geometry_analysis":["Separate editable primitive objects form the assemblies; inventory records 72 meshes and no parent on the named furniture components: /evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:3-5; object_inventory.jsonl:6-72.","Evaluator AABB screening identifies overlaps, including Sofa lower plinth/Seat cushion and Seat cushion.002/Chaise extension, but explicitly leaves physical interpenetration unknown; some overlaps may be intentional assembly construction. /evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/geometry_candidates.json:162-185,408-419. No student support or collision check is evidenced."],\n  "semantic_correspondence":[\n    {"gt_instance_ids":[77],"gt_semantic_label":"sofa with chaise","student_object_names":["Sofa lower plinth","Sofa back","Seat cushion","Seat cushion.001","Seat cushion.002","Back cushion","Back cushion.001","Back cushion.002","Sofa arm","Sofa arm.001","Sofa foot","Sofa foot.001","Sofa foot.002","Sofa foot.003","Chaise extension","Chaise foot","Chaise foot.001"],"confidence":"high","basis":["GT statistics:241-255; original object_inventory.jsonl:6-22; build.py:22-34; delivered and reference images"],"ambiguity":["Assembly extent and hidden feet require mask validation; individual cushions are not matched separately."],"orientation_identifiability":"Front faces camera; hidden ba