om intersecting horizontal shelves and continuous uprights; dark joint marks are visible in the candidate. The student\'s chair is a single subdivided solidified shell with four rods, not an established swivel mechanism (/evidence/final_source/build.py:30-34,73-84). The door is a narrow unparented block without a hinge assembly (/evidence/final_source/build.py:88-89; original object inventory:168).", "Evaluator inventory places mattress bounds at z=0.36-0.74 and platform at z=0.20-0.40, so their bounding boxes overlap; this is broad-phase evidence only, not proof of an unintended mesh intersection (/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/object_inventory.jsonl:46-51). The evaluator\'s 553 AABB overlap candidates are not confirmed collisions (/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/summary.json:8)."],\n  "semantic_correspondence": [\n    {"gt_instance_ids":[19],"gt_semantic_label":"open cubby shelf","student_object_names":["Bookcase side","Bookcase side.001","Bookcase horizontal shelf","Bookcase horizontal shelf.001","Bookcase horizontal shelf.002","Bookcase horizontal shelf.003","Bookcase horizontal shelf.004","Bookcase upright","Bookcase upright.001","Bookcase upright.002","Bookcase upright.003"],"confidence":"high","basis":["/evidence/reference_gt/reference_instance_statistics.json:18-31","/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/capture/original/object_inventory.jsonl:35-45","reference and delivered images"],"ambiguity":["Different column count and proportions; proposed assembly union requires separate validation."],"orientation_identifiability":"Upright front-facing grid identifiable; hidden back and depth uncertain."},\n    {"gt_instance_ids":[46],"gt_semantic_label":"mattress","student_object_names":["White mattress","Mattress piping"],"confidence":"high","basis":["/evidence/reference_gt/reference_instance_statistics.json:106-119","/evidence/independent_evaluation/original_inspection/captu